    {
      "id": "1039322",
      "title": "",
      "description": "Scope of Work:\r\nThis is to allow for work on critical signal upgrades within the Green Line central subway.\r\n\r\nTravel Time:\r\nRiders should allow for ample extra travel time. Rider trip times are expected to be at least 25 minutes longer than usual. \r\n\r\nAccessibility:\r\nAll shuttle buses are accessible to riders with disabilities. Accessible van service will be available for Green Line stops between Kenmore & North Station as well as Downtown Crossing. See station personnel for assistance.\r\n\r\nCommuter Rail Alternates:\r\nFramingham/Worcester Line is free between Lansdowne and South Station on 11/9-11/5.\r\n\r\nBus Alternatives:\r\nRoute 39 Bus will be fare-free. This route runs parallel to the Green Line E Branch \r\n\r\nRoute 57 Bus will be fare-free. This route runs parallel to the Green Line B Branch between Kenmore and Packard's Corner.\r\n\r\nShuttle Bus Locations:\r\n\r\nBack Bay/Copley:\r\nWestbound Shuttle Stop - Stuart St @ Dartmouth St (Route 501/504 bus stop)\r\n\r\nHynes Convention Center:\r\nEastbound & Westbound Shuttle Stop  - Commonwealth Ave @ Massachusetts Ave\r\n\r\nKenmore:\r\nEastbound Shuttle Stop - 512 Commonwealth Ave\r\nWestbound Shuttle Stop - Commonwealth Ave @ Kenmore St\r\n\r\nBlandford Street:\r\nEastbound Shuttle Stop - Commonwealth Ave @ Blandford St (Route 57 bus stop)\r\nWestbound Shuttle Stop - Commonwealth Ave @ Silber Way (Route 57 bus stop)\r\n\r\nBoston University East:\r\nEastbound Shuttle Stop - Commonwealth Ave @ Hinsdale St (Route 57 bus stop)\r\nWestbound Shuttle Stop - Commonwealth Ave @ Granby St (Route 57 bus stop)\r\n\r\nBoston University Central:\r\nEastbound and Westbound Shuttle Stops - Commonwealth Ave @ St Mary's St (Route 57 bus stop)  \r\n\r\nAmory Street:\r\nEastbound Shuttle Stop - Commonwealth Ave @ Pleasant St (Route 57 bus stop)\r\nWestbound Shuttle Stop  - Commonwealth Ave @ Buick St (Route 57 bus stop)\r\n\r\nBabcock Street:\r\nWestbound only Drop Off - Commonwealth Ave @ Babcock St (Route 57 bus stop) \r\nEastbound riders can use the Amory St stop at Commonwealth Ave @ Pleasant St (Route 57 bus stop)\r\n\r\nSt Mary's St:\r\nNo shuttles\r\n\r\nHawes St:\r\nInbound - Beacon St @ Hawes St\r\nOutbound - Beacon St opp Hawes St\r\n\r\nKent St:\r\nNo shuttles\r\n\r\nSaint Paul St:\r\nInbound & Outbound - Beacon St @ St Paul St\r\n\r\nCoolidge Corner:\r\nInbound & Outbound - Beacon St @ Harvard St\r\n\r\nSummit Ave:\r\nInbound - Beacon St @ Marion St\r\nOutbound - Beacon St @ Summit Ave\r\n\r\nBrandon Hall:\r\nNo Shuttles\r\n\r\nFairbanks St:\r\nInbound - Beacon St @ Fairbanks St\r\nOutbound - Beacon St @ Lancaster Ter\r\n\r\nWashington Sq:\r\nInbound & Outbound - Beacon St @ Washington St\r\n\r\nTappan St:\r\nInbound - Beacon St @ Tappan St\r\nOutbound - Beacon St @ Williston Rd\r\n\r\nDean Rd:\r\nInbound - Beacon St @ Dean Rd\r\nOutbound - Beacon St @ Corey Rd\r\n\r\nEnglewood Ave:\r\nInbound - Beacon St @ Clinton Path\r\nOutbound - Beacon St @ Englewood Ave\r\n\r\nCleveland Circle:\r\nBeacon St @ Cleveland Cir Station\r\n\r\nAdd This to your Calendar:\r\nhttps://calendarlink.com/event/1Abaa\r\n\r\nView Shuttle Route and Stops:\r\nhttps://platform.remix.com/project/e8205522?",
